{'symbol': 'LYB', 'date': '2023-05-17 18:08:00', 'title': 'LYONDELLBASELL PRICES PUBLIC OFFERING OF INAUGURAL GREEN BOND', 'text': 'HOUSTON , MAY 17, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- LYONDELLBASELL (NYSE: LYB) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT LYB INTERNATIONAL FINANCE III, LLC ("LYB INTERNATIONAL FINANCE"), ITS WHOLLY-OWNED SUBSIDIARY, PRICED A PUBLIC OFFERING (THE "OFFERING") OF $500,000,000 AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF 5.625% GUARANTEED NOTES DUE 2033 (THE "NOTES"). THE NOTES WILL BE FULLY AND UNCONDITIONALLY GUARANTEED BY LYONDELLBASELL.'}